.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%T Bluetooth Core Specification
.%O Version 6.0
.%Q Bluetooth SIG
.Re
.Rs
.%T HID over GATT Profile (HOGP)
.%O Version 1.0
.%Q Bluetooth SIG
.Re
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
daemon first appeared in
.Fx 16.0 .
It was originally developed under the name
.Nm btled
and was renamed to
.Nm blued
to reflect its evolution into a general-purpose BLE daemon.
